label: "ADRs (atomic keyspace, streams, streaming-value I/O, batched deletion)"
statement: >
  docs/decisions/ — ADR 0001 (atomic keyspace), 0002 (streams), 0003
  (streaming-value I/O, proposed draft), 0004 (streaming-value I/O v2,
  supersedes 0003), 0005 (batched deletion, accepted 2026-08-23).
  Append-only; supersede, never edit. Each is registered as a Decision
  vertex in situation/record/ (decision-0001… decision-0005); liveness
  is read from the supersedes chain — 0001, 0002, 0004, and 0005 are
  live, 0003 is superseded by 0004. Walk the chain before relitigating
  any of these choices.
